# round 33 (w49): is the round-31 gap the head or the solve? The layer-free form (the deletion's pFBA vector appended to the FBA affine, no flux layer, pathway + ProtT5) read 0.871 pooled with four of six cells selecting before epoch 14, against the cached-solve head's 0.917; the head differs in two ways, zero initialization and log(1 + |v|). Two arms paired by seed against w47_pathfbapfba: the same standardized vector with the solve columns zero-initialized (pathfbapfbazero), and log1p with zero init (pathfbapfbalog), the flux head's own construction with nothing in the graph. Six seeds, pooled cells, ESS_MEM=72g ESS_CPUS=12
